{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ブログを開いて下さりありがとうございます。櫻坂46の関有美子です🐱"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"櫻坂46の1stアルバム『As you know?』が発売になりました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"色んなことがありましたが、無事発売日を迎えることが出来てとても嬉しいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"このアルバムは櫻坂46の今がぎゅぎゅっと詰め込まれた作品となっています。\nぜひ大切に聴いてほしい1枚となりました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなが笑顔のジャケ写だからなのか、はじめてのアルバムだからなのか、形になったものを見て手元に届いてみると、いつも以上に感動してしまいました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きっと私にとってずっとずっと大切な宝物になるんだと思います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"このアルバム制作、発売に関わってくださった全ての皆様へ感謝の気持ちでいっぱいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もちろん、手にとってくださったあなたにも。\n本当にいつもありがとうございます☺︎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"発売日に渋谷ストリームさんとSHIBUYA TSUTAYAさんにお邪魔させていただきました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まずは渋谷ストリームさんの #ゆみこかめら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH2HNAMG7S5D9SFSDH6M2S0","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この写真がすごく好きです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH2HPGFFPH3DX8RKDR399EX","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH2HQH75W55GCGPQ2GXVFX5","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてSHIBUYA TSUTAYAさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH2HRH7NTFCJ9T1FW4WMPKE","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"めちゃくちゃわらってる！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH2HSFTFM6STZJEWW2XBN4F","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんと、今回メンバーひとりひとりのコーナーを作っていただいていました！\n嬉しすぎて写真いっぱい撮っちゃった！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に愛で溢れていて心があったかくなりました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH2HTFXPGPKFBD3P1955Y1R","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH2HVGDR6AA7JX65C35XF0C","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH2HWG0742AXA03TSWY72YX","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH2HXDYT563BC9WQSC1TDRN","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH2HYFFVMZNM216JKW7M756","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たくさんサインかいたよー！\nぜんぶみつけてね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH2HZDQ88YRSGNT2EWGER2R","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH2J0EVX804HFFR8NECRQDB","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">